# telegram_app

Follow [TelegramLibrarySkill/SKILL.md](../../.cursor/skills/TelegramLibrarySkill/SKILL.md) and [smartexchange.md](../../.cursor/skills/TelegramLibrarySkill/smartexchange.md).

Before coding: search aiogram docs via MCP (`search_aiogram_docs`) or `scripts/aiogram_docs_scraper/search.py` — do not grep the full `reference/` mirror.

## Invariants

- Customer menus: **reply keyboards** (`ReplyKeyboardMarkup`), not inline message buttons.
- Channel price broadcasts may use inline URL buttons.
- Sync Django/Celery call sites: `telegram_app.services.telegram_client.TelegramService`.
- FSM state: Django `BotSession` via custom storage — no second session store.
- Poller: one asyncio loop; never `asyncio.run()` per update.
- Do not touch Iraniu / Request-Manage-System bots.
